    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:0.000000",
      "translatedText": "그런 일은 염두에 두지 말라",
      "text": "Don't think[care] about it. or <b>Dismiss</b> it from your mind. or You had better forget about it."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:0.000000",
      "translatedText": "외무 장관이 갑자기 해임되었다",
      "text": "The foreign minister was suddenly <b>dismissed</b>."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:0.000000",
      "translatedText": "오늘은 이것으로 수업을 끝마치겠습니다",
      "text": "So far for today. or Class (is) <b>dismissed</b>."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:0.000000",
      "translatedText": "그는 직무를 게을리하여 해고당했다",
      "text": "He was <b>dismissed</b> for neglecting his duties."
